{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38121","headline":"乱後却至近甸有感 · 韩偓","name":"乱後却至近甸有感","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"狂童容易犯金门，比屋齐人作旅魂。\n夜户不扃生茂草，春渠自溢浸荒园。\n关中忽见屯边卒，塞外飜闻有汉村。\n堪恨无情清渭水，渺茫依旧绕秦原。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38121.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38121","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}